  "commit_message": "fix(ui-mode): make the filter summary reachable from the keyboard (#42449)\n\nCloses #42439\n\n## problem\n\nthe filter summary under the search input in UI Mode toggles the status and project filters when you click it, but it is a `div` with an `onClick`:\n\n```tsx\n<div className='filter-summary' title={...} onClick={() => setExpanded(!expanded)}>\n```\n\nso tab skips it, enter and space do nothing, and a screen reader announces it as ordinary text rather than a control that expands something. the chevron",
